WEBVTT

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:00.326
which is very out of character for me.

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:02.276
AG: She wasn't just exhausted.

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:03.466
She was puzzled.

00:01:03.490 --> 00:01:08.356
AHP: I started with why can't I get
these dumb errands done on my to-do list.

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:12.466
And that opened the door
to these larger questions of burnout.

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:15.157
AG: Annie ended up writing
an article about burnout,

00:01:15.181 --> 00:01:16.414
which went viral.

00:01:16.438 --> 00:01:19.474
She argued that millennials
are so overworked and exhausted

00:01:19.498 --> 00:01:22.358
that simple errands, like mailing a letter

00:01:22.382 --> 00:01:24.652
or taking your shirts to the dry cleaner,

00:01:24.676 --> 00:01:26.336
feel impossible to complete.

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:30.216
AHP: I think the condition of burnout
is the millennial condition.